Source: rootapp
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://www.rootapp.com

Package: rootapp
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set re-derived from the 0.9.155 AppImage (2026-10-27 full teardown:
# sha256 matches the spec pin, 483 files, 18 ELFs, ASCII + UTF-16 scans). A .deb
# has no auto-deps, so this mirrors the RPM spec exactly:
#   * DT_NEEDED union of every shipped ELF (readelf -d), minus glibc and the
#     bundled-JRE-only libjawt;
#   * + the libraries the payload loads by name at runtime (Chromium dlopen
#     list and `Root`'s .NET DllImport probe table): wayland, GL/EGL, Pulse +
#     PipeWire, the X11 extras, OpenSSL/Kerberos, VA-API.
# Every name below was checked against the live Debian testing + sid Packages
# index (2026-10-27) - that check is why libxt6 and libatspi2.0-0 are gone:
# neither exists any more (t64 renames), so the old Depends was unsatisfiable
# on both targets. wl-clipboard is gone too: zero payload references.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, at-spi2-core, hicolor-icon-theme, xdg-utils, libasound2t64, libatk1.0-0t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libatspi2.0-0t64, libcairo2, libdbus-1-3, libegl1, libexpat1, libfontconfig1, libgbm1, libgcc-s1, libglib2.0-0t64, libgl1, libgssapi-krb5-2, libgtk-3-0t64, libice6, libnspr4, libnss3, libpango-1.0-0, libpipewire-0.3-0t64, libpulse0, libsm6, libssl3t64, libstdc++6, libudev1, libva-drm2, libva2, libvulkan1, libwayland-client0, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxcursor1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxi6, libxinerama1, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2, libxss1, libxt6t64, libxtst6
Description: Discord alternative for gaming communities and large groups
 Root App is a new Discord alternative, designed for gaming communities
 and large online groups.
